\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 First Thing: pivotal Mississippi  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  case begins at supreme court\b0\par\par\uc2 Nicola Slawson \par \uc2 1,508 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 December 2021\par 11:17 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Oral arguments will be heard today in the most important \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights case in decades, plus how Pearl Harbour changed baseball history\par \par \uc2 Good morning.\par \par \uc2 The most important \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights case in decades, which will decide the future of \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access across the country, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/dec/01/oral-arguments-mississippi-abortion-case-begin-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 begins today}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 US supreme court\uc2  is is scheduled to convene at 10am ET and is expected to begin hearing oral arguments in Dobbs v Jackson Women\u8217\'20\'19s Health Organization, which centers on whether the state of Mississippi can ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 15 weeks gestation.\par \par \uc2 Campaigners warn the case poses a direct threat to the legal underpinnings of Roe v Wade, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/nov/30/abortion-rulings-history-roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 landmark 1973 decision}}}\uc2  that guaranteed the constitutional right to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Presently, Roe v Wade protects the right to terminate a pregnancy up to the point a fetus can survive outside the womb, widely regarded as 24 weeks. A full term pregnancy is 39 weeks.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Who is the case named for? It\u8217\'20\'19s named for \uc2 Dr Thomas Dobbs\uc2 , the head of Mississippi\u8217\'20\'19s health department, and Jackson Women\u8217\'20\'19s Health Organization, the last \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinic in Mississippi.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 When will a decision be made? The court is not expected to issue a decision on the case until June 2022, but oral arguments may offer clues to the justices\u8217\'20\'19 thinking ahead of the ruling.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Why is the Mississippi \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights case so important? It could lead to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/nov/30/explainer-mississippi-abortion-rights-roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weakening or overturning of Roe v Wade}}}\uc2 . If that were to happen, tens of millions people of reproductive age across the country would be affected.\par \par \uc2 Trump tested positive for Covid few days before Biden debate, chief of staff says in new book\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  tested positive for Covid-19 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/dec/01/trump-tested-positive-covid-before-biden-debate-chief-staff-mark-meadows-book"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 three days before his first debate}}}\uc2  against \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 , the former president\u8217\'20\'19s fourth and last chief of staff has revealed in a new book.\par \par \uc2 Mark Meadows\uc2  also writes that though he knew each candidate was required \u8220\'20\'1Cto test negative for the virus within 72 hours of the start time \u8230\'20\'26 Nothing was going to stop [Trump] from going out there\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Trump, Meadows says in the book, returned a negative result from a different test shortly after the positive.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, the stunning revelation of an unreported positive test follows a year of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/sections/latest-updates-trump-covid-19-results/2020/10/03/919898777/timeline-what-we-know-of-president-trumps-covid-19-diagnosis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 speculation}}}\uc2  about whether Trump, then 74 years old, had the potentially deadly virus when he faced Biden, 77, in Cleveland on 29 September \u8211\'20\'13 and what danger that might have presented.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 When did Trump admit he had Covid? Not until 2 October. The White House said he announced that result within an hour of receiving it. He went to hospital later that day.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 When will the memoir be out? Meadows\u8217\'20\'19 memoir, The Chief\u8217\'20\'19s Chief, will be published next week by All Seasons Press, a conservative outlet.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/30/mark-meadows-testify-capitol-attack-trump-white-house"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Meadows has agreed to testify}}}\uc2  before the House select committee investigating the Capitol attack.\par \par \uc2 Ghislaine Maxwell was present when Epstein abused me, accuser testifies\par \par \uc2 The first accuser in Ghislaine Maxwell\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/30/ghislaine-maxwell-trial-jeffrey-epstein-testimony"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 child sex trafficking trial testified}}}\uc2  in Manhattan federal court yesterday that she was just 14 when the British socialite allegedly lured her into Jeffrey Epstein\u8217\'20\'19s abusive orbit.\par \par \uc2 This accuser, who used the name \u8220\'20\'1CJane\u8221\'20\'1D in court, alleged that Maxwell was sometimes present when this abuse occurred and participated on some occasions.\par \par \uc2 Epstein, a New York financier and convicted sex offender who counted \uc2 Bill Clinton\uc2  and Prince Andrew among his acquaintances, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2019/jul/08/jeffrey-epstein-sex-trafficking-charges-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 killed himself}}}\uc2  at a New York City jail in August 2019, while he was awaiting his own sex-trafficking trial. Maxwell, 59, the daughter of the late British press baron Robert Maxwell, was arrested in New Hampshire in July 2020.\par \par \uc2 Maxwell is on trial for six counts related to her alleged involvement in Epstein\u8217\'20\'19s sexual abuse of minor teenagers. She has pleaded not guilty.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 How did Jane meet Maxwell? Jane told the court she attended a renowned youth arts camp in Michigan, Interlochen Center for the Arts, in summer 1994 and was approached by Maxwell while eating ice-cream. A man, who turned out to be Epstein, came and joined Maxwell.\par \par \uc2 Michigan school shooting leaves three students dead and eight wounded\par \par \uc2 A 15-year-old student opened fire at his Michigan high school on Tuesday, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/30/michigan-school-shooting-oxford"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 killing three other students}}}\uc2  and wounding eight other people, authorities say.\par \par \uc2 Oakland county undersheriff Mike McCabe identified the three students who were killed as a 16-year-old boy and two girls aged 14 and 17. He said two of the wounded were undergoing surgery as of Tuesday evening and six others were in stable condition. One of the people wounded was a teacher, authorities said.\par \par \uc2 The suspect\u8217\'20\'19s motives for the attack at Oxford high school in Oxford Township, near Detroit, were not yet known, McCabe said at a news conference. The suspect\u8217\'20\'19s parents advised their son not to talk to investigators, as is his right.\par \par \uc2 The teenager\u8217\'20\'19s father bought the gun \u8211\'20\'13 a 9mm pistol \u8211\'20\'13 on Black Friday, four days before the shooting, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://eu.freep.com/story/news/local/michigan/oakland/2021/11/30/oxford-high-school-shooting-michigan/8812485002/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according to Detroit Free Press}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Who was killed in the shooting? The victims have been named as Tate Myre, 16, Hana St Juliana, 14 and Madisyn Baldwin, 17, the sheriff\u8217\'20\'19s office said.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 What do we know about the suspect? He is a sophomore from the Village of Oxford and was in class during the day, McCabe said.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 What has been said about the possible motive? Some of the parents of students at the school said their children had reported there had been rumors of possible violence at the school \u8220\'20\'1Cfor a long time\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Support the Guardian\u8217\'20\'19s fact-based journalism\par \par \uc2 As a subscriber to First Thing, we know you\u8217\'20\'19re plugged into what\u8217\'20\'19s happening across the US. Countless forces are undermining its democracy: from politicians and platforms to pundits and hyper-partisanship. The challenges we\u8217\'20\'19re facing going into the new year and beyond are considerable \u8211\'20\'13 and fact-based journalism has never been more crucial.\par \par \uc2 So we\u8217\'20\'19re raising $1.25m to fund our reporting in 2022. If you can, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://support.theguardian.com/contribute?acquisitionData=%7B%22source%22%3A%22EMAIL%22%2C%22componentType%22%3A%22NEWSLETTER_SUBSCRIPTION%22%2C%22componentId%22%3A%22USEOY2021_FIRSTTHING_GIVINGTUESDAY%22%2C%22campaignCode%22%3A%22USEOY2021%22%7D&INTCMP=eml_usmsp_emedt_mem_USEOY2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 please make a year-end gift to the Guardian}}}\par \par \uc2 In other news \u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The author Alice Sebold apologized on Tuesday to the man who was exonerated last week of the 1981 rape that was the basis for her memoir Lucky. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/30/alice-sebold-apologizes-1981-rape-anthony-broadwater"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sebold said she was struggling with the role she played}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cwithin a system that sent an innocent man to jail\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 World Health Organization\uc2  has said those not fully vaccinated who are vulnerable to Covid-19, including over-60s, should delay travel to areas with community transmission, as more countries imposed curbs to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/dec/01/older-unvaccinated-people-should-delay-travel-says-who-as-omicron-curbs-spread"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 combat the spread of the new Omicron variant}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Some Republican states are expanding unemployment benefits for employees who have been fired or quit over vaccine mandates, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/dec/01/republicans-vaccine-mandates-unemployment-benefits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a move critics say in effect pays people for not getting vaccinated}}}\uc2 . Four states \u8211\'20\'13 Iowa, Tennessee, Florida, and Kansas \u8211\'20\'13 have recently changed their rules on unemployment.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Saudi Arabia used \u8220\'20\'1Cincentives and threats\u8221\'20\'1D as part of a lobbying campaign to shut down a \uc2 UN\uc2  investigation of human right violations committed by all sides in the Yemen conflict, according to sources with close knowledge of the matter. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/dec/01/saudi-arabia-yemen-un-human-rights-investigation-incentives-and-therats"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Saudi effort ultimately succeeded}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Don\u8217\'20\'19t miss this:\par \par \uc2 how Pearl Harbor stopped the birth of the LA Browns and changed baseball history\par \par \uc2 Japan\u8217\'20\'19s surprise attack on Pearl Harbor 80 years ago not only ensured the US\u8217\'20\'19s entry into the second world war. It {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/sport/2021/dec/01/how-pearl-harbor-stopped-the-birth-of-the-la-browns-and-changed-baseball-history"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inadvertently but categorically changed baseball history}}}\uc2 . One day after the attack, Major League Baseball\u8217\'20\'19s owners were expected to approve the move of the American League\u8217\'20\'19s St Louis Browns to Los Angeles for 1942. But in the aftermath of the attack, the owners unanimously rejected the move. Had the owners approved it, it would have changed the landscape of American professional sports, and might have generated more sweeping social, cultural and economic shifts.\par \par \uc2 Climate check:\par \par \uc2 renewable energy has \u8216\'20\'18another record year of growth\u8217\'20\'19 says IEA\par \par \uc2 It has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2021/dec/01/renewable-energy-has-another-record-year-of-growth-says-iea"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 another record year for renewable energy}}}\uc2 , despite the Covid-19 pandemic and rising costs for raw materials around the world, according to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.iea.org/analysis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 International Energy Agency}}}\uc2  (IEA). About 290GW of new renewable energy generation capacity, mostly in the form of wind turbines and solar panels, has been installed around the world this year, beating the previous record last year. On current trends, renewable energy generating capacity will exceed that of fossil fuels and nuclear energy combined by 2026.\par \par \uc2 Last Thing: Japan\u8217\'20\'19s party season loses lustre as workers dread drinking with the boss\par \par \uc2 Not everyone in Japan is looking forward to observing the time-honoured tradition of the bonenkai (forget-the-year) party season \u8211\'20\'13 a period where groups of colleagues get together to drink, eat and drink some more, even as the country begins to rediscover its gregarious side after 18 months of the coronavirus pandemic. Many workers have said they will be mounting silent protest when they imbibe alongside their colleagues, and, crucially, their bosses. Respondents to a survey said they dreaded the tradition, while {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/dec/01/utter-torment-japans-party-season-loses-lustre-as-workers-dread-drinking-with-the-boss"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one described bonenkai as nothing but \u8220\'20\'1Cutter torment\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020211201ehc1001gw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
