\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 First Thing: US could face \u8216\'20\'18fifth wave\u8217\'20\'19 of Covid as Omicron spreads\b0\par\par\uc2 Nicola Slawson \par \uc2 1,255 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 November 2021\par 13:11 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Israel seals borders and Morocco bans flights as new variant fears rise. Plus, tributes pour in for fashion maverick Virgil Abloh\par \par \uc2 Good morning.\par \par \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s chief medical adviser, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/anthony-fauci"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Anthony Fauci }}}\uc2 , said on Sunday the US has \u8220\'20\'1Cthe potential to go into a fifth wave\u8221\'20\'1D of coronavirus infections amid rising cases and stagnating vaccination rates.\par \par \uc2 Early evidence suggests the heavily mutated variant poses a higher risk of reinfection than earlier variants and that it could also be more transmissible.\par \par \uc2 Last night, shortly after the first Omicron cases in North America were confirmed in Canada, the White House said Biden met Fauci and other advisers on returning to Washington from holiday in Nantucket.\par \par \uc2 Fauci said any fifth wave of cases \u8220\'20\'1Cwill really be dependent upon what we do in the next few weeks to a couple of months\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 How are other countries reacting to the spread of Omicron? Israel is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/nov/28/coronavirus-new-restrictions-omicron-israel"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 barring entry to all foreign nationals }}}\uc2  and Morocco is suspending all incoming flights for two weeks. Many countries, including Brazil, Canada, \uc2 European Union\uc2  states, Iran and the UK, have placed restrictions on travel from various southern African countries.\par \par \uc2 Ghislaine Maxwell sex-trafficking trial expected to go before jury\par \par \uc2 The trial of the British socialite Ghislaine Maxwell is expected to go before a jury in New York City on Monday, as opening statements follow finalization of the panel of 12 jurors and six alternates.\par \par \uc2 Maxwell, 59, has pleaded not guilty on six counts related to her alleged involvement in the late financier {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/jeffrey-epstein"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jeffrey Epstein }}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s sexual abuse of teen girls, some as young as 14. The indictment cites four accusers though it is believed more will take the stand.\par \par \uc2 The charges include conspiracy to entice minors to travel to engage in illegal sex acts, enticement of a minor to travel to engage in illegal sex acts, conspiracy to transport minors with intent to engage in criminal sexual activity, transportation of a minor with intent to engage in criminal sexual activity, sex trafficking conspiracy, and sex trafficking of a minor.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Epstein, a convicted paedophile, killed himself in a Manhattan federal jail in August 2019, while {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2019/jul/08/jeffrey-epstein-sex-trafficking-charges-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 awaiting trial }}}\uc2 . Maxwell\u8217\'20\'19s alleged crimes took place from 1994 to 2004, prosecutors have said.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Authorities arrested the Briton, the daughter of the late press baron Robert Maxwell, on 2 July 2020 at an estate in the small New Hampshire town of Bradford.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Maxwell has pleaded not guilty to all the charges against her and is expected to challenge claims she groomed underage girls.\par \par \uc2 Michael Flynn\par \par \uc2 apparently calls QAnon \u8216\'20\'18total nonsense\u8217\'20\'19 despite his links\par \par \uc2 Michael Flynn\uc2 , Donald Trump\u8217\'20\'19s first national security adviser, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/29/michael-flynn-trump-ally-qanon-cia-left"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  appears to have called QAnon \u8220\'20\'1Ctotal nonsense\u8221\'20\'1D and a \u8220\'20\'1Cdisinformation campaign\u8221\'20\'1D }}}\uc2  created by the CIA and the political left \u8211\'20\'13 despite his own extensive {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://theintercept.com/2021/06/27/qanon-michael-flynn-digital-soldiers/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 links }}}\uc2  to the conspiracy theory and seeming eagerness to serve as its hero.\par \par \uc2 Flynn\u8217\'20\'19s apparent statement was revealed by Lin Wood, a pro-Trump attorney and QAnon supporter once allied with the disgraced former general.\par \par \uc2 QAnon followers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2020/aug/25/qanon-conspiracy-theory-explained-trump-what-is"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 believe }}}\uc2  in the existence of a secret cabal of pederastic cannibal satanists, dominated by Democrats, against whom Trump is fighting. Followers also believe \uc2 John F Kennedy Jr\uc2  is not dead and will soon return to lead them. Many recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.rollingstone.com/culture/culture-features/qanon-jfk-jr-conspiracy-theorist-convention-dallas-dealey-plaza-1261278/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 congregated }}}\uc2  in Dallas, waiting for that to happen. The \uc2 FBI\uc2  in Dallas, waiting for that to happen. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2019/aug/01/conspiracy-theories-fbi-qanon-extremism"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 considers }}}\uc2  QAnon a potential source of extremist violence.\par \par \uc2 Trump has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2020/aug/19/trump-qanon-praise-conspiracy-theory-believers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 refused to disavow }}}\uc2  QAnon believers. \uc2 Tucker Carlson\uc2 , of Fox News, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/mar/06/fox-news-host-tucker-carlson-qanon-followers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 called }}}\uc2  them \u8220\'20\'1Cgentle patriots\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Where was the statement made? Wood released a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://redirect.viglink.com/?format=go&jsonp=vglnk_163812404439618&key=0de604de366e10157cd309534403dfb2&libId=kwjjojlv0101k4gd000DL37s6gbnngwg3&loc=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.thedailybeast.com%2Fqanon-hero-michael-flynn-secretly-said-qanon-is-total-nonsense%3Fref%3Dhome&v=1&out=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2Fjanbobrowicz%2Fstatus%2F1464857388901670912&title=QAnon%20Hero%20Michael%20Flynn%20Secretly%20Said%20QAnon%20Is%20%E2%80%98Total%20Nonsense%E2%80%99&txt=released%20a%20recording"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recording }}}\uc2  of what appeared to be a call between him and Flynn on Telegram, a social media and messaging app favored by far-right extremists.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Is it real? \uc2 The Guardian\uc2  could not verify the authenticity of the recording.\par \par \uc2 In other news \u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The\par \par \uc2 fashion designer Virgil Abloh has died after suffering from cancer, it has been announced. The fashion maverick was creative head at \uc2 Louis Vuitton\uc2  and founder of Off-White. Gigi Hadid, Kendall Jenner and Justin Timberlake were among the stars {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/fashion/2021/nov/28/virgil-abloh-off-white-designer-dies-at-41"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 paying tribute to the \u8220\'20\'1Conce-in-a-generation creative mind\u8221\'20\'1D }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 An episode of the Simpsons in which the cartoon American family visit Tiananmen Square is absent from \uc2 Disney\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s streaming channel in Hong Kong, at a time when authorities are clamping down on dissent. The missing episode adds to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/nov/29/disney-channel-launches-in-hong-kong-without-the-simpsons-tiananmen-square-episode"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 concerns that mainland-style censorship is becoming the norm }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The private office of the Prince of Wales has dismissed as \u8220\'20\'1Cfiction\u8221\'20\'1D claims Prince Charles speculated on grandchildren\u8217\'20\'19s skin colour. A new book claims that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/uk-news/2021/nov/29/claim-prince-charles-speculated-on-grandchildrens-skin-colour-is-fiction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 it was Charles who asked about the \u8220\'20\'1Ccomplexion }}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D of the Duke and Duchess of Sussex\u8217\'20\'19s future children.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Missouri Senate candidate is hoping Trump notices his neckwear as he seeks endorsement from the former president, which he believes still carries the ultimate weight . \uc2 Billy Long\uc2 , who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/29/missouri-senate-billy-long-trump-endorsement-ties"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wears a tie that Trump signed with a sharpie }}}\uc2 , said: \u8220\'20\'1CIf he endorses in this race \u8230\'20\'26 it\u8217\'20\'19s over.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Don\u8217\'20\'19t miss this: Rita Moreno on West Side Story, dating Brando and joy at 90\par \par \uc2 She overcame abuse to break Hollywood, romanced Marlon Brando, dated Elvis to make him jealous and fought hard for civil rights. Now in her 10th decade, she is busier and happier than ever. She is one of only six women to have bagged the Egot (Emmy, Grammy, Oscar and Tony awards), alongside \uc2 Helen Hayes\uc2 , Audrey Hepburn, Barbra Streisand, Whoopi Goldberg and Liza Minnelli. Yet {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2021/nov/29/i-owe-an-enormous-debt-to-therapy-rita-moreno-on-west-side-story-dating-brando-and-joy-at-90"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 she has spent much of her career battling typecasting or simply not being cast at all }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8230\'20\'26 or this: What will US\u8217\'20\'19s future look like if \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  becomes a crime again?\par \par \uc2 If Roe v Wade were to be overturned, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/nov/29/us-abortion-supreme-court-roe-v-wade"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 at least 26 states hostile to \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  would outlaw \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  either immediately }}}\uc2  or as quickly as possible, according to the \uc2 Guttmacher Institute\uc2 , a pro-choice research organization. \b \highlight22\uc2 Abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  advocates believe this would probably result in desperate people (who have the resources) seeking abortions in more liberal states where the procedure remains legal, such as Illinois or New York. In just one example, Louisiana has passed a \u8220\'20\'1Ctrigger-law\u8221\'20\'1D designed to outlaw \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  if Roe is overturned. A person from Louisiana seeking an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  would need to reach Kansas to obtain one legally.\par \par \uc2 Climate check: Nobel-winning stock market theory used to help save coral reefs\par \par \uc2 A Nobel prize-winning economic theory used by investors is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2021/nov/28/stock-markets-modern-portfolio-theory-mpt-used-to-pick-coral-reefs-arks-conservation-survive-climate-crisis"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 showing early signs of helping save threatened coral reefs }}}\uc2 , scientists say. Researchers at Australia\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 University of Queensland\uc2  used modern portfolio theory (MPT), a mathematical framework developed by the economist Harry Markowitz in the 1950s to help risk-averse investors maximise returns, to identify the 50 reefs or coral sanctuaries around the world that are most likely to survive the climate crisis and be able to repopulate other reefs, if other threats are absent.\par \par \uc2 Want more environmental stories delivered to your inbox?\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/info/ng-interactive/2021/oct/20/sign-up-for-down-to-earth-the-best-way-to-make-sense-of-the-biggest-environment-stories"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sign up to our new newsletter Down to Earth }}}\uc2  to get original and essential reporting on the climate crisis every week\par \par \uc2 Last Thing: Canada digs deep into strategic reserves to cover maple syrup shortage\par \par \uc2 Maple syrup producers have been forced to raid the world\u8217\'20\'19s only stockpile of the highly valued sweet treat, as surging worldwide demand combined with an unusually short harvest season in 2021. The Federation of Quebec Maple Syrup Producers, sometimes referred to as the \u8220\'20\'1COpec of maple syrup\u8221\'20\'1D, has released about 22m kg of syrup from its strategic reserve to cover a shortfall driven by a short and warm spring in 2021, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/2021/11/25/1059236116/canada-taps-into-strategic-reserves-to-deal-with-massive-shortage-of-maple-syrup"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NPR reported }}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020211129ehbt001e8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
