\par\par \uc2 World news\par \b \uc2 Cori Bush and other congresswomen share personal  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  stories\b0\par\par\uc2 Gloria Oladipo \par \uc2 400 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 October 2021\par 08:24 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Three Democrats \u8211\'20\'13 Bush, Barbara Lee and \uc2 Pramila Jayapal\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 spoke before House oversight committee hearing on reproductive rights\par \par \uc2 Democratic lawmakers {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://19thnews.org/2021/09/cori-bush-barbara-lee-pramila-jayapal-testify-abortions/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shared the personal stories}}}\uc2  behind their past decisions to have abortions during a House oversight committee meeting about reproductive rights on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 Representatives Cori Bush of Missouri, Barbara Lee of California and \uc2 Pramila Jayapal\uc2  of Washington testified during the committee hearing and also shared details about their abortions earlier during an exclusive interview with MSNBC on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 During testimony, Lee described how, in the days before the supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s 1973 Roe v Wade decision legalized \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the US, she had to travel to a \u8220\'20\'1Cback-alley clinic\u8221\'20\'1D in Mexico with a family friend to receive the procedure, an experience that terrified her.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI was one of the lucky ones, Madam Chair. A lot of girls and women in my generation died from unsafe abortions \u8230\'20\'26 My personal experience shaped my beliefs to fight for people\u8217\'20\'19s reproductive freedom,\u8221\'20\'1D said Lee during the hearing.\par \par \uc2 After experiencing severe postpartum depression after a previous pregnancy, Jayapal said she too decided to terminate her pregnancy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhether the choice to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  is easy or hard, whether there are traumatic situations or not, none of that should be the issue. It is simply nobody\u8217\'20\'19s business what choices we as pregnant people make about our own bodies,\u8221\'20\'1D said Jayapal.\par \par \uc2 Bush, who also shared her experience in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.vanityfair.com/news/2021/09/cori-bush-congress-abortion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 an interview with Vanity Fair}}}\uc2  and at a rally earlier this month, discussed her decision to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  following a sexual assault when she was 17.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CTo all the Black women and girls who have had abortions and will have abortions, we have nothing to be ashamed of. We live in a society that has failed to legislate love and justice for us,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/therecount/status/1443588085694926857"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said Bush}}}\uc2  during the committee proceedings.\par \par \uc2 The hearing examined Texas\u8217\'20\'19s SB8 law, that bans abortions after six weeks and allows private citizens to sue anyone accused of aiding or abetting an illegal procedure.\par \par \uc2 The supreme court, which decided earlier this month not to block the Texas law, will also be hearing arguments on 1 December that could challenge the Roe v Wade decision, another critical moment that has brought conversations around reproductive rights to the fore.\par \par \uc2 The committee hearing examined the Texas law and other potential obstacles to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  access.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210930eh9u002jq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
