\par\par \uc2 Culture\par \b \uc2 Colbert on Arizona audit: \u8216\'20\'18They hired Maga fans, and even they couldn\u8217\'20\'19t say No 45 won\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Horton \par \uc2 1,089 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 September 2021\par 15:38 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Late-night hosts talk Arizona\u8217\'20\'19s GOP-led election \u8216\'20\'18audit\u8217\'20\'19, which reaffirmed Biden\u8217\'20\'19s win, and \uc2 Rudy Giuliani\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s Fox News issues\par \par \uc2 Stephen Colbert\par \par \uc2 Stephen Colbert mocked the humiliating conclusion of a partisan effort to overturn the 2020 election in Arizona, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/24/republican-audit-arizona-bigger-lead-biden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 concluded }}}\uc2  on Friday by reaffirming \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s victory over \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  by 360 more votes than initially reported.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWow, he really did get tired of winning,\u8221\'20\'1D the Late Show host joked.\par \par \uc2 It was a disappointing end for the Republican-led, delusional election review in Maricopa county \u8211\'20\'13 the state\u8217\'20\'19s most populous, which tallied 2.1m votes \u8211\'20\'13 that was based on Trump\u8217\'20\'19s lies about election \u8220\'20\'1Cfraud\u8221\'20\'1D and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/may/14/arizona-election-audit-recount-ballots-maricopa-county"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 resorted to such ludicrous measures }}}\uc2  as scanning ballots with UV light.\par \par \uc2 The investigation was run by a company called Cyber Ninjas, which had no expertise in election audits and whose CEO endorsed conspiracy theories that the election was stolen from Trump. \u8220\'20\'1CSo they hired Maga fans, and even they couldn\u8217\'20\'19t say that No 45 won,\u8221\'20\'1D said Colbert. \u8220\'20\'1CThat\u8217\'20\'19s like hiring your mom to judge the \u8216\'20\'18handsomest boy contest\u8217\'20\'19 and still losing to a 78-year-old guy from Delaware.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSo Biden has won Arizona and the Republicans all know it,\u8221\'20\'1D he continued. \u8220\'20\'1CThey called for the audit, they paid for the audit, they conducted the audit, which confirmed the former president lost on the forensic audit.\u8221\'20\'1D Or as Trump put it at a rally on Saturday: \u8220\'20\'1CWe won on the Arizona forensic audit yesterday at a level that you wouldn\u8217\'20\'19t believe.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSo nothing\u8217\'20\'19s gonna shut this guy up \u8211\'20\'13 no matter what the results are, he\u8217\'20\'19s just going to go out and say he won,\u8221\'20\'1D Colbert said. \u8220\'20\'1CHe\u8217\'20\'19s not playing three-dimensional chess. He\u8217\'20\'19s not even playing regular chess. He\u8217\'20\'19s just shoving the bishop up his butt and yelling \u8216\'20\'18Yahtzee!\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Seth Meyers\par \par \uc2 On Late Night, Seth Meyers recounted another ignominious end: \uc2 Rudy Giuliani\uc2  on Fox News. After Politico {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/newsletters/playbook/2021/09/24/scoop-fox-to-rudy-youre-banned-494458"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported }}}\uc2  that the network had banned Trump\u8217\'20\'19s personal lawyer from appearing on-air, a source close to Fox News clarified to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://deadline.com/2021/09/rudy-giuliani-not-banned-from-fox-news-not-relevant-1234843921/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Deadline }}}\uc2  that he hadn\u8217\'20\'19t been booked simply because he was not \u8220\'20\'1Crelevant\u8221\'20\'1D to recent coverage. \u8220\'20\'1CDamn, it\u8217\'20\'19s one thing to ban him because you\u8217\'20\'19re afraid of the Dominion lawsuit,\u8221\'20\'1D said Meyers, \u8220\'20\'1Cbut to tell him you just don\u8217\'20\'19t want him any more? It\u8217\'20\'19s like breaking up with a boyfriend and telling him \u8216\'20\'18No, it\u8217\'20\'19s not because my mother doesn\u8217\'20\'19t like you, it\u8217\'20\'19s because you\u8217\'20\'19re ugly and bad at sex.\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLest we forget, Rudy is a real human being, with real feelings, and not, as he appears, a fictional goblin Italian grandmothers threaten children with if they don\u8217\'20\'19t brush their teeth,\u8221\'20\'1D Meyers continued. \u8220\'20\'1CAnd Rudy was apparently deeply emotionally affected by this news\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 a source said Giuliani was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/24/rudy-giuliani-reportedly-banned-fox-news"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1Creally hurt\u8221\'20\'1D }}}\uc2  because years ago, he helped get \uc2 Rupert Murdoch\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s Fox News on Time Warner and thus available to viewers in New York City.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CDoes Rudy think \uc2 Rupert Murdoch\uc2  cares about his hurt feelings?\u8221\'20\'1D Meyers remarked. \u8220\'20\'1CIf Rudy so much as tried to speak to Murdoch at a dinner, Murdoch would simply nod at one of his henchmen and have Rudy thrown into a watery pit full of crocodiles.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt seems like the real reason Rudy was banned probably has a lot more to do with a simple financial and legal calculation\u8221\'20\'1D related to \uc2 Dominion Voting Systems\uc2  , which has slapped the network with a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/apr/04/dominion-trump-disinformation-fox-news-sidney-powell-giuliani-mike-lindell-lawsuits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $1.6bn defamation lawsuit }}}\uc2  for spreading baseless conspiracy theories about the integrity of the company\u8217\'20\'19s voting machines in the 2020 election. Dominion has also personally sued Giuliani, who was instrumental in fomenting said conspiracies on Fox News.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is what happens when the rightwing fantasy world of unhinged conspiracy theories collides with reality,\u8221\'20\'1D said Meyers. \u8220\'20\'1CFox News wants to fend off a lawsuit from Dominion, and they know Rudy\u8217\'20\'19s batshit conspiracy theories can\u8217\'20\'19t hold up in court.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trevor Noah\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s a look at the fallout from Texas\u8217\'20\'19s anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law and what actually happens when states ban \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 If you don\u8217\'20\'19t know, now you know. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/pwijCNLXPi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/pwijCNLXPi }}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 The Daily Show (@TheDailyShow) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheDailyShow/status/1442667715379044353?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 28, 2021 }}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 The Daily Show (@TheDailyShow)\par \par \uc2 And on the Daily Show, Trevor Noah checked in on fallout from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/07/un-experts-condemn-texas-anti-abortion-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  law }}}\uc2  in Texas, which bans \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at six weeks (before most women know they\u8217\'20\'19re pregnant) and allows citizens to sue anyone who \u8220\'20\'1Cassists\u8221\'20\'1D a woman receive the procedure, from doctors to \uc2 Uber\uc2  drivers.\par \par \uc2 Noah dug into what is known to happen when states restrict \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 : women seek healthcare elsewhere, with increased hurdles and often increased risk of harm. \u8220\'20\'1CPeople, this is despicable,\u8221\'20\'1D said Noah of reports of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/02/as-texas-patients-prepare-to-travel-hundreds-of-miles-for-abortion-access-out-of-state-clinics-brace-for-surge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weeks-long waitlists }}}\uc2  at clinics in Oklahoma and Mexico. \u8220\'20\'1CYou shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t have to cross state lines to get a simple medical procedure performed. That\u8217\'20\'19s something people do when they\u8217\'20\'19re running from the law because they, I don\u8217\'20\'19t know, kidnapped their ex\u8217\'20\'19s puppy after she refused to give them visitation rights.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Like most laws, the Texas measure disproportionately burdens the poor, who may not be able to afford a long-distance road trip or days off work. \u8220\'20\'1CWhen women are stuck between a rock and a hard place, they take matters into their own hands,\u8221\'20\'1D said Noah. He rolled a news clip from 1965 about the epidemic of \u8220\'20\'1Cillegal pregnancy termination\u8221\'20\'1D, from which 350,000 women suffered complications. \u8220\'20\'1CThat wasn\u8217\'20\'19t that long ago,\u8221\'20\'1D said Noah. \u8220\'20\'1CThe last time \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was outlawed in America, hundreds of thousands of women suffered complications each year, with hundreds dying.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CSo these supposedly \u8216\'20\'18pro-life\u8217\'20\'19 laws are actually going to end up hurting a lot of women, and probably killing some of them.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 This article was amended on 28 September 2021. An earlier version stated that Fox News said \uc2 Rudy Giuliani\uc2  had not been booked because he was not relevant to coverage; in fact, the network did not comment but a source told Deadline he was not relevant.\par \par \uc2 2021-09-28T15:38:28Z 2021-09-28T18:27:02Z {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://media.guim.co.uk/2404c8ae163e4e4396870d68ed439ccb64db7c63/244_124_2468_1481/500.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://media.guim.co.uk/2404c8ae163e4e4396870d68ed439ccb64db7c63/244_124_2468_1481/500.jpg }}}\uc2  Stephen Colbert: \u8216\'20\'18So they hired Maga fans, and even they couldn\u8217\'20\'19t say that No 45 won. That\u8217\'20\'19s like hiring your mom to judge the \u8216\'20\'18handsomest boy contest\u8217\'20\'19 and losing to a 78-year-old guy from Delaware.\u8217\'20\'19\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210928eh9s002bf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
