\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Amy Coney Barrett claims supreme court \u8216\'20\'18not comprised of partisan hacks\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Martin Pengelly in New York and Joan E Greve in Washington \par \uc2 729 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 September 2021\par 19:04 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Justice spoke alongside \uc2 Mitch McConnell\uc2  at Kentucky event a week after supreme court declined to block Texas \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  lawUS politics \u8211\'20\'13 live coverage\par \par \uc2 Claiming the supreme court \u8220\'20\'1Cis not comprised of a bunch of partisan hacks\u8221\'20\'1D, Amy Coney Barrett {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2021/09/12/amy-coney-barrett-supreme-court-511603"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told an audience}}}\uc2  at a Kentucky center named for the Republican Senate leader \uc2 Mitch McConnell\uc2  that \u8220\'20\'1Cjudicial philosophies are not the same as political parties\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Speaking alongside McConnell a little more than a week after she and four other conservatives on the court {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/01/texas-abortion-law-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declined}}}\uc2  to block {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/11/salesforce-texas-abortion-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a Texas law}}}\uc2  which all but outlaws \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the state, the devout Catholic also insisted the panel does not judge cases based on personal beliefs.\par \par \uc2 Justices must be \u8220\'20\'1Chyper-vigilant to make sure they\u8217\'20\'19re not letting personal biases creep into their decisions,\u8221\'20\'1D Barrett said, \u8220\'20\'1Csince judges are people, too\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Critics say the \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2021/aug/31/supreme-court-us-cases-shadow-docket"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shadow docket}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D ruling in the Texas case has effectively overturned Roe v Wade, the 1973 ruling which safeguards \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. The term \u8220\'20\'1Cshadow docket\u8221\'20\'1D refers to emergency rulings issued without usual proceedings including oral arguments.\par \par \uc2 Barrett spoke on Sunday at the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://louisville.edu/mcconnellcenter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 McConnell Center}}}\uc2  at the \uc2 University of Louisville\uc2 , a venue created by and named for the Republican leader in the Senate.\par \par \uc2 In 2016, McConnell blocked \uc2 Barack Obama\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s final pick for the court, \uc2 Merrick Garland\uc2 , claiming it was too close to an election and the next president should decide.\par \par \uc2 Between 2017 and 2020, McConnell then quickly shepherded through three picks made by Donald Trump. Barrett was the last \u8211\'20\'13 in place of \uc2 Ruth Bader Ginsburg\uc2 , a heroine to US liberals \u8211\'20\'13 shortly before an election Trump lost.\par \par \uc2 McConnell, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.courier-journal.com/story/news/politics/mitch-mcconnell/2021/09/12/justice-amy-coney-barrett-supreme-court-decisions-arent-political/8310849002/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Louisville Courier-Journal}}}\uc2  reported, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.courier-journal.com/story/news/politics/mitch-mcconnell/2021/09/12/justice-amy-coney-barrett-supreme-court-decisions-arent-political/8310849002/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 praised}}}\uc2  Barrett for not trying to \u8220\'20\'1Clegislate from the bench\u8221\'20\'1D and for being from \u8220\'20\'1CMiddle America\u8221\'20\'1D. Barrett is from Indiana and, unlike the other eight justices, did not attend Harvard or Yale.\par \par \uc2 Barrett said: \u8220\'20\'1CMy goal today is to convince you that this court is not comprised of a bunch of partisan hacks.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The event was picketed by protesters supporting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  rights. One {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.courier-journal.com/story/news/politics/mitch-mcconnell/2021/09/12/justice-amy-coney-barrett-supreme-court-decisions-arent-political/8310849002/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told the Louisville Courier Journal}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CWith what\u8217\'20\'19s been happening in Texas, I don\u8217\'20\'19t want it to spread to Kentucky \u8230\'20\'26 And so, we\u8217\'20\'19re just coming to let Mitch know how a lot of citizens feel about this issue.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Echoing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.forbes.com/sites/alisondurkee/2021/09/12/supreme-court-justice-stephen-breyer-dismisses-retirement-calls-says-politics-just-one-of-many-factors/?sh=c1be6623e28e"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recent comments by Stephen Breyer}}}\uc2 , a liberal, about the court and politics, Barrett said: \u8220\'20\'1CTo say the court\u8217\'20\'19s reasoning is flawed is different from saying the court is acting in a partisan manner. I think we need to evaluate what the court is doing on its own terms.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Breyer, the oldest justice on the court at 83, is under pressure from liberals to retire so \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  and Democrats who hold the Senate on the casting vote of the vice-president, \uc2 Kamala Harris\uc2 , can confirm a long-term replacement.\par \par \uc2 Barrett\u8217\'20\'19s appointment to replace Ginsburg tilted the court 6-3 in favor of conservatives. The chief justice, \uc2 John Roberts\uc2 , sided with the liberals in opposing the ruling which allowed the Texas law to stand.\par \par \uc2 Among observers, Barrett\u8217\'20\'19s remarks met with widespread skepticism.\par \par \uc2 The veteran TV newscaster Dan Rather {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DanRather/status/1437423923864367104"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  on \uc2 Twitter\uc2 : \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re apparently playing the \u8216\'20\'18Things you can\u8217\'20\'19t make up\u8217\'20\'19 game this morning. So Supreme Court Justice Amy Coney Barrett (speaking at a center named after \uc2 Mitch McConnell\uc2 , introduced by Senator McConnell) worries that the court is seen as \u8216\'20\'18a bunch of partisan hacks\u8217\'20\'19.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Scott Shapiro, a law professor at Yale, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/scottjshapiro/status/1437265721717886976"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  Barrett had \u8220\'20\'1Cexpressed concerns Sunday that irony is dead\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Sheldon Whitehouse, a Democratic senator from Rhode Island, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SenWhitehouse/status/1437427917366124550"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CNot \u8216\'20\'18partisan hacks\u8217\'20\'19? Then explain 80-0 partisan 5-4 record for big donors. And explain judicially conservative principles rolled over to get those wins for donors who put you on the court.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Many liberals say Barrett, guided by her religious beliefs, wants to outlaw \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The new Texas law offers financial rewards to private citizens reporting \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The Biden administration {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/09/biden-administration-sue-texas-abortion-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has sued}}}\uc2 , calling the law \u8220\'20\'1Cclearly unconstitutional\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Garland, now US attorney general, has said the law is one \u8220\'20\'1Call Americans should fear\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In Louisville, Barrett answered questions submitted in writing.\par \par \uc2 Asked about the decision to let stand the Texas law which offers financial rewards to private citizens reporting abortions, she said it would be inappropriate to comment.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210913eh9d002bd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
