\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 First Thing: Biden introduces vaccine mandate for 100 million workers\b0\par\par\uc2 Clea Skopeliti \par \uc2 980 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 September 2021\par 10:46 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Two-thirds of US workers will be required to get vaccinated. Plus: Muslim Americans on the toll of 9/11Don\u8217\'20\'19t already get First Thing in your inbox? Sign up here\par \par \uc2 Good morning.\par \par \uc2 Two-thirds of American workers will be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/09/joe-biden-coronavirus-covid-pandemic-white-house"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 required to get vaccinated against Covid-19}}}\uc2  under fresh mandates announced by \uc2 Joe Biden\uc2  on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The president took a stern approach to those who continued to refuse a jab as Delta cases surge, saying: \u8220\'20\'1CMany of us are frustrated with the nearly 80 million Americans who are still not vaccinated even though the vaccine is safe, effective and free.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The mandate, which will affect 100 million workers, will require all employers with more than 100 employees to ensure their workers are vaccinated or tested weekly. Business that do not comply could face fines of up to nearly $14,000 per violation.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The Biden administration will also require all workers in healthcare settings that receive Medicaid or Medicare reimbursement be vaccinated , affecting more than 17 million healthcare workers .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 He also called on large entertainment venues to ask attendees for proof or vaccination or a negative test result.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 More than 175 million people who are already fully vaccinated will be offered booster shots when the \uc2 Food and Drug Administration\uc2  and \uc2 Centers for Disease Control and Prevention\uc2  grant approval.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile,\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/10/covid-coronavirus-us-colleges-fall-semester"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 staff at colleges are nervous}}}\uc2  about the start of the semester, with some colleges adopting unclear contact tracing systems while others shun mask and vaccine mandates.\par \par \uc2 Biden administration sues Texas over extreme \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban\par \par \uc2 The Biden administration has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/09/biden-administration-sue-texas-abortion-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sued Texas over its near-total ban}}}\uc2  on \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , calling it \u8220\'20\'1Cclearly unconstitutional\u8221\'20\'1D. Senate bill 8 outlaws \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  from about six weeks \u8211\'20\'13 a point at which most women are not aware they are pregnant.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 What is Senate bill 8? The law, which came into effect on 1 September, bans \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  once embryonic cardiac activity is detected and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/sep/08/texas-abortion-vigilantes-sb8-citizens-sue"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 incentivizes private citizens}}}\uc2  to sue \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  providers seen as helping women get a termination beyond that time.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 What does the justice department say? It is arguing that the law, which offers no exceptions for rape or incest, \u8220\'20\'1Cillegally interferes with federal interests\u8221\'20\'1D, and the US attorney general said the department would protect rights under a federal law known as the Freedom of Access to Clinic Entrances.\par \par \uc2 California takes aim at Amazon with landmark bill\par \par \uc2 California lawmakers have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/10/california-bill-amazon-warehouse-quotas"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 passed a bill that would disrupt}}}\uc2  many of the algorithmically determined systems that Amazon uses to monitor workers. The bill, which is yet to be signed by the governor, \uc2 Gavin Newsom\uc2 , would affect all warehouse jobs in the state.\par \par \uc2 What does the bill mean for warehouse workers?\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Warehouses would be made to disclose the metrics used to track their employees to government agencies and the workers themselves.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Penalties for \u8220\'20\'1Ctime off-task\u8221\'20\'1D would be banned. These are used to discourage employees from using the bathroom and other necessary breaks, leading to reports of workers urinating in bottles.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The bill also prohibits retaliation against workers who complain, after several employees {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2020/may/05/amazon-protests-union-organizing-cracking-down-workers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported being fired }}}\uc2  for doing so.\par \par \uc2 In other news \u8230\'20\'26\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 More than 100 international passengers flew out of Afghanistan on Thursday in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/sep/10/afghanistan-flight-kabul-doha-lands-foreign-passengers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first large-scale departure}}}\uc2  since the US withdrawal last month. The flight, which was approved by the \uc2 Taliban\uc2 , came amid a worsening {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/global-development/2021/sep/10/afghan-female-police-officers-live-in-fear-of-taliban-reprisals"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 human rights situation}}}\uc2  in the country.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The civil rights leader \uc2 Al Sharpton\uc2  has urged Biden to abolish the filibuster. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/10/al-sharpton-filibuster-voting-rights-joe-biden"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 president has so far resisted calls}}}\uc2  to scrap the centuries-old parliamentary tool \u8211\'20\'13 which Sharpton said flew in the face of the Biden\u8217\'20\'19s pledges to protect voting rights.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The US and China must not \u8220\'20\'1Cveer into conflict\u8221\'20\'1D, \uc2 Xi Jinping\uc2  and Biden have agreed in the leaders\u8217\'20\'19 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/sep/10/joe-biden-xi-jinping-us-china-phone-call-veer-conflict"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 first phone call in seven months}}}\uc2 . The discussion comes amid frustrated efforts to improve relations between the powers.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 California is expected to become the first state to outlaw \u8220\'20\'1Cstealthing\u8221\'20\'1D, the act of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/09/california-stealthing-ban-remove-condom-sex"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 removing a condom during sex}}}\uc2  without consent. The bill, which has been sent to the governor\u8217\'20\'19s office, would make it a civil, but not criminal, offence.\par \par \uc2 Stat of the day: the world will have 27bn Covid vaccine doses by June 2022\par \par \uc2 By June 2022, 27bn Covid vaccine doses will have been produced \u8211\'20\'13 enough to fully immunise the world\u8217\'20\'19s population twice over. Despite this, if the slow and unequal pace of distribution continues, more than half the world will remain unvaccinated by next summer. The former UK prime minister {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/commentisfree/2021/sep/09/west-vaccine-doses-covid-production"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Gordon Brown calls on rich countries}}}\uc2  to distribute the doses equitably.\par \par \uc2 Don\u8217\'20\'19t miss this: Muslim Americans on the toll of 9/11\par \par \uc2 The 9/11 attacks killed 2,977 people and injured thousands. Together with the planes, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/09/muslim-americans-september-11-keith-ellison-zainab-johnson-mehdi-hasan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Erum Salam writes}}}\uc2 , the terrorists hijacked the religion of more than 1.8 billion people on that day. In the ensuing years, Muslim Americans have endured {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/09/muslim-america-september-11-war-on-terror"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 racism, government surveillance and violent hate crimes}}}\uc2 . Muslim Americans in the arts, politics, healthcare, education and the media {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/video/2021/sep/09/muslim-americans-on-life-after-911-the-toll-has-been-huge-video"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 speak about}}}\uc2  the \u8220\'20\'1Chuge toll\u8221\'20\'1D that moment had on their lives.\par \par \uc2 Last Thing: creepy crawl space\par \par \uc2 In 1995, when Amber Dawn was 20, a stranger secretly lived in the crawl space of her attic for six months. She would come home to find cans of soda and ramen packets missing, and for a while assumed her brother, who had a key, was eating her food. Although the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2021/sep/10/experience-a-stranger-secretly-lived-in-my-home"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 experience continued to haunt her for years}}}\uc2 , Dawn now jokes \u8220\'20\'1Che was the best roommate I ever had: he kept to himself and always put the toilet seat down\u8221\'20\'1D. Still, she\u8217\'20\'19s thankful to now be living in a house without an attic.\par \par \uc2 Sign up\par \par \uc2 First Thing is delivered to thousands of inboxes every weekday. If you\u8217\'20\'19re not already signed up, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/info/2018/sep/17/guardian-us-morning-briefing-sign-up-to-stay-informed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 subscribe now}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Get in touch\par \par \uc2 If you have any questions or comments about any of our newsletters please email {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:newsletters@theguardian.com"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 newsletters@theguardian.com}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210910eh9a001bi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
