\par\par \uc2 Culture\par \b \uc2 Samantha Bee brands supreme court \u8216\'20\'18gutless monsters\u8217\'20\'19 for Texas  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  decision\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Horton \par \uc2 956 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 September 2021\par 15:28 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Late-night hosts discuss Texas\u8217\'20\'19s six-week \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  ban, flooding in New York and Covid\u8217\'20\'19s new Mu variant\par \par \uc2 Samantha Bee\par \par \uc2 Samantha Bee tore into the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/01/texas-abortion-law-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  law in Texas}}}\uc2 , the most restrictive in the nation, on Wednesday evening \u8211\'20\'13 a week after the supreme court, in a midnight 5-4 decision, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/law/2021/sep/06/supreme-court-trump-texas-abortion-law-democracy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 refused to block the measure}}}\uc2  which bars \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after six weeks, before many women know they\u8217\'20\'19re pregnant. \u8220\'20\'1CThe Texas law circumvents Roe v Wade and, as Justice \uc2 Sonia Sotomayor\uc2  noted in her dissent, is flagrantly unconstitutional,\u8221\'20\'1D the Full Frontal host said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhile the supreme court\u8217\'20\'19s anti-pussy posse claimed they were \u8216\'20\'18declining to block\u8217\'20\'19 the Texas law on procedural grounds,\u8221\'20\'1D Bee continued, \u8220\'20\'1Cthis was just the latest partisan abuse of the court\u8217\'20\'19s shadow docket,\u8221\'20\'1D emergency decisions made hastily \u8211\'20\'13 in this case, with just three days of consideration \u8211\'20\'13 without oral arguments. The court\u8217\'20\'19s majority decision in this case was unsigned, and just a paragraph long. \u8220\'20\'1COne paragraph, and unsigned? You fucking cowards,\u8221\'20\'1D Bee fumed. \u8220\'20\'1CIf you\u8217\'20\'19re taking away our reproductive rights, at least own that you\u8217\'20\'19re gutless monsters.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The measure bars public officials from enforcing the law, but encourages private citizens to sue anyone who assists a woman in receiving an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 doctors, clinic staff, Uber drivers \u8211\'20\'13 and promises to provide $10,000 in reward for a victorious case. \u8220\'20\'1CAlthough you know people are gonna be pissed when that money only comes in Jesus bucks,\u8221\'20\'1D Bee joked. \u8220\'20\'1CYou can only use them at Hobby Lobby, and even then, they\u8217\'20\'19re only good for pipe cleaners and long sticks.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBut Texas lawmakers aren\u8217\'20\'19t just doing this shit for funsies,\u8221\'20\'1D she added. \u8220\'20\'1CThey\u8217\'20\'19re strategically trying to prevent the law from being challenged,\u8221\'20\'1D as the measure dodges constitutionality challenges through the doctrine of \u8220\'20\'1Csovereign immunity,\u8221\'20\'1D which allows people to sue states only if they\u8217\'20\'19re targeting an official who enforces a law. \u8220\'20\'1CGod, can you imagine if any of these useless twats put as much creativity and time into helping the millions of American children who have no secure home or food?\u8221\'20\'1D Bee wondered.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs soul-crushing as it is to see how worthless our supreme court has become, it\u8217\'20\'19s hard not to want to walk right into our rapidly rising oceans and never return,\u8221\'20\'1D Bee concluded, pointing to organizations like the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.lilithfund.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lilith Fund}}}\uc2 , {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://teafund.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Texas Equal Access Fund}}}\uc2 , and the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theafiyacenter.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Afiya Center}}}\uc2  fighting back in Texas. \u8220\'20\'1CWe need to fight this oppressive law and all the others that come after it, because no person should be forced to give birth.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Seth Meyers\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThese days, you don\u8217\'20\'19t have to look very far for bad news,\u8221\'20\'1D said Seth Meyers on Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s Late Night. \u8220\'20\'1CHere in New York City, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/02/new-york-flooding-state-of-emergency-ny-city-flash-flood-nyc-hurricane-ida-remnants"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 destruction from Hurricane Ida}}}\uc2  was so bad, there were practically rivers flowing into people\u8217\'20\'19s homes and cars floating in 5ft of water. The flooding was so bad the subway looked like a whitewater rapid.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s undeniable, as it has been for a long time, that climate change is intensifying,\u8221\'20\'1D he continued. \u8220\'20\'1CMuch of the [western US] has been on fire this summer, wildfire has drifted all across the country and made the air toxic on the east coast, and New York City just had to declare its first ever flash flood emergency. It\u8217\'20\'19s getting so bad that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UPXUG8q4jKU"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Pizza Rat}}}\uc2  has taken up water ballet.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Meyers also touched on the Texas \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law, upheld by the supreme court in a last-minute, midnight decision. \u8220\'20\'1CThat\u8217\'20\'19s right, they did it in the dead of the night, in a little more than a page, in the same way a rich kid half-asses a freshman English paper because he knows he can\u8217\'20\'19t fail out,\u8221\'20\'1D Meyers said.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThey gutted a woman\u8217\'20\'19s right to choose in Texas, and who knows where else next, despite never commanding majority support from the American people, and they don\u8217\'20\'19t give a fuck because they\u8217\'20\'19re there for life,\u8221\'20\'1D he continued. \u8220\'20\'1CI mean, if that\u8217\'20\'19s how our government is going to work, then why not have a fucking monarchy? At least then we\u8217\'20\'19d have more messy tabloid drama and a \uc2 Netflix\uc2  show called The Gavel where the men get played by actors who are way better looking than the actual royals.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Stephen Colbert\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThere\u8217\'20\'19s a new [coronavirus] variant in town, and it\u8217\'20\'19s called Mu,\u8221\'20\'1D said Stephen Colbert on Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s Late Show. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2021/sep/01/who-monitoring-new-coronavirus-variant-named-mu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 variant}}}\uc2 , found in 167 people in LA county, is named after the 12th letter of the Greek alphabet, \u8220\'20\'1Cand not, as I thought, for the Pokemon Mu,\u8221\'20\'1D said Colbert. \u8220\'20\'1CEither way, gotta get vaccinated, or you\u8217\'20\'19ll catch \u8217\'20\'19em all.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Last week, the \uc2 World Health Organization\uc2  deemed Mu a \u8220\'20\'1Cvariant of interest\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COK, in the PR world, that\u8217\'20\'19s what we call \u8216\'20\'18buzz,\u8217\'20\'19\u8217\'20\'19 Colbert joked. \u8220\'20\'1CA \u8216\'20\'18variant of interest\u8217\'20\'19 is less dire than \u8216\'20\'18variant of concern,\u8217\'20\'19 which is how Delta is categorized. The rating system goes, \u8216\'20\'18variant of interest,\u8217\'20\'19 \u8216\'20\'18variant of concern,\u8217\'20\'19 \u8216\'20\'18variant of pants-crapping\u8217\'20\'19 sometimes called \u8216\'20\'18code brown,\u8217\'20\'19 and finally \u8216\'20\'18variant of is there any more room on Jeff Bezos\u8217\'20\'19s penis rocket to escape the planet?\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The WHO said in a press release that the vaccines may not work against Mu, as the variant has properties to evade immune responses caused by a \u8220\'20\'1Cconstellation of mutations\u8221\'20\'1D \u8211\'20\'13 \u8220\'20\'1Ca constellation also known as The Big Downer,\u8221\'20\'1D Colbert quipped.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBut there is some good-ish news out there,\u8221\'20\'1D he continued, as 75% of US adults have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/us/75-us-adults-have-taken-least-one-dose-covid-19-vaccine-cdc-2021-09-07/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 taken at least one dose}}}\uc2  of a Covid vaccine, \u8220\'20\'1Cmeaning this life-saving vaccine is just slightly more popular than me {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://uproxx.com/tv/stephen-colbert-mustache/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shaving off my mustache}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210909eh990025v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
