\par\par \uc2 Culture\par \b \uc2 Colbert on Texas  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  law: \u8216\'20\'18Great news for The Handmaid\u8217\'20\'19s Tale\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Adrian Horton \par \uc2 872 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 September 2021\par 16:37 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Late-night hosts also discuss flooding from Hurricane Ida and people taking Ivermectin instead of Covid vaccines\par \par \uc2 Stephen Colbert\par \par \uc2 Stephen Colbert returned to the Late Show from a two-week holiday with a questionable mustache and a full slate of bad news to recap. First, last week\u8217\'20\'19s storm damage from Hurricane Ida, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/06/i-dont-have-a-choice-hurricane-ida-leaves-devastated-louisiana-communities-struggling-with-new-reality"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 knocked out power in Louisiana}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/02/new-york-flooding-state-of-emergency-ny-city-flash-flood-nyc-hurricane-ida-remnants"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dumped a record 3.15in of rain}}}\uc2  in a single hour in Central Park. The downpour flooded New York\u8217\'20\'19s subways and delayed flights at Newark airport, whose baggage room was inundated. \u8220\'20\'1CSo, pretty good day at Newark airport,\u8221\'20\'1D joked Colbert.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou know the climate crisis is bad when the once in a century global pandemic is the second biggest story of the day,\u8221\'20\'1D he continued, \u8220\'20\'1Cand in that regard, things are not good\u8221\'20\'1D, as US hospitalizations \u8220\'20\'1Chave more than doubled since last Labor Day due to the Delta variant.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CUnfortunately, thanks to fear-mongering and misinformation, a lot of people still aren\u8217\'20\'19t getting vaccinated,\u8221\'20\'1D he added. \uc2 Walgreens\uc2 , CVS, \uc2 Rite Aid\uc2  and state governments have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/america-has-wasted-least-15-million-covid-vaccine-doses-march-n1278211"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tossed more than 15m doses}}}\uc2  of wasted Covid-19 vaccines, \u8220\'20\'1Cbut that does mean 15 million Covid immune dumpster rats,\u8221\'20\'1D Colbert joked. \u8220\'20\'1CBut don\u8217\'20\'19t worry about the anti-vaxxers being unprotected, because they have found a new drug that also does not protect them,\u8221\'20\'1D also known as Ivermectin, a horse-dewormer. \u8220\'20\'1CSo you\u8217\'20\'19ll probably still get Covid, but on the bright side, you could win the Preakness.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Colbert also touched on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/01/texas-abortion-law-supreme-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new \b  \highlight22abortion\b0 \highlight22  law in Texas}}}\uc2 , which bans \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after six weeks \u8211\'20\'13 before most women known they\u8217\'20\'19re pregnant \u8211\'20\'13 and went into effect 1 September. \u8220\'20\'1CHowever you feel about \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and you do, what the Texas legislature did here is crazy,\u8221\'20\'1D he said of the measure the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2021/sep/07/un-experts-condemn-texas-anti-abortion-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 UN called}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cstructural sex and gender-based discrimination at its worst.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNormally, a broad ban like that would likely get shot down by the precedent of Roe v Wade, which while a controversial political flashpoint, has the been the settled law of the land for 50 years,\u8221\'20\'1D he explained. \u8220\'20\'1CSo, knowing that, Texas Republicans crafted this law to avoid judicial review entirely. In response to this clear end runaround our judicial system, the supreme court said: \u8216\'20\'18I like beer.\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In a 5-4 decision, the court\u8217\'20\'19s conservative majority said they had \u8220\'20\'1Cserious questions regarding the constitutionality of the Texas law\u8221\'20\'1D, but refused to block it due to \u8220\'20\'1Ccomplex\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1Cnovel\u8221\'20\'1D procedural questions. \u8220\'20\'1CBut isn\u8217\'20\'19t answering complex and novel procedural questions all we pay you knuckleheads to do?\u8221\'20\'1D Colbert retorted.\par \par \uc2 The law encourages civilians to sue any Texan who assists with an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after six weeks, promising they can recover legal fees as well as $10,000 if they win. \u8220\'20\'1CThey\u8217\'20\'19re incentivizing neighbors to turn on each other for cash,\u8221\'20\'1D Colbert lamented. \u8220\'20\'1CBad news for fans of privacy rights, but great news for The Handmaid\u8217\'20\'19s Tale, which just got a late Emmy nomination for best documentary.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Jimmy Kimmel\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhat a weird summer \u8211\'20\'13 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nytimes.com/2021/09/07/arts/music/jamie-spears-britney-conservatorship.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Britney is free}}}\uc2  and every woman in Texas isn\u8217\'20\'19t,\u8221\'20\'1D said Jimmy Kimmel in his first late-night appearance back from a two-month summer vacation.\par \par \uc2 Kimmel mocked Americans who took Ivermectin as a treatment for coronavirus but refused to get the vaccine \u8211\'20\'13 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s like if you\u8217\'20\'19re a vegan you say, \u8216\'20\'18no, I don\u8217\'20\'19t want a hamburger, give me that can of Alpo instead.\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COne of the reasons these Sea Biscuits are opting for Ivermectin is because they don\u8217\'20\'19t trust big pharma,\u8221\'20\'1D he added. \u8220\'20\'1CWhich is fine, I guess, except for the fact that Ivermectin is made by Merck, which is the fourth largest pharmaceutical company in the world.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 That company released a statement clarifying that there\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cno scientific basis\u8221\'20\'1D for use of Ivermectin as a preventative measure against Covid, and a \u8220\'20\'1Cconcerning lack of safety data in the majority of studies\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CListen, if a pharmaceutical company says \u8216\'20\'18please don\u8217\'20\'19t take the drug we\u8217\'20\'19re selling,\u8217\'20\'19 you should probably listen to them,\u8221\'20\'1D Kimmel said. \u8220\'20\'1COr, you could just go with a TikTok posted by a disgraced veterinarian instead.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Seth Meyers\par \par \uc2 And on Late Night, Seth Meyers recapped Biden\u8217\'20\'19s trip to New York and New Jersey to survey storm damage from the remnants of Hurricane Ida. \u8220\'20\'1CThen he\u8217\'20\'19s going to head to Texas to look into that \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law, maybe drop by Florida and get some folks to wear masks and if there\u8217\'20\'19s time, maybe head to California and help with that recall mess and then finish up the week in Maine to kill those lobster zombies,\u8221\'20\'1D Meyers joked. \u8220\'20\'1COh, did you not hear? Yeah, every state has something bad.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In other news, billionaire Mark Cuban recently became an investor in a start-up company creating artificial intelligence versions of NFTs [non-fungible tokens] \u8220\'20\'1Cthat have the ability to converse with people,\u8221\'20\'1D said Meyers, \u8220\'20\'1Craising the obvious question: what?\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 And \uc2 Amazon\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s healthcare business, \uc2 Amazon\uc2  Care, is reportedly looking to start offering in-person visits in 20 US cities, Meyers said, \u8220\'20\'1Cand they\u8217\'20\'19re focusing on the places where people need the most medical help: their own warehouses.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210908eh98002bl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
