\par\par \uc2 Opinion\par \b \uc2 What would happen if I were pregnant in Texas right now?\b0\par\par\uc2 Zo\u235\'00\'EB Ettinger \par \uc2 726 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 September 2021\par 21:21 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Texas just banned \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  at six weeks. I didn\u8217\'20\'19t even know I was pregnant until five, and that\u8217\'20\'19s earlier than most\par \par \uc2 Four years ago, when I was a 22-year-old college student in Virginia, I found out I was pregnant. I knew I was late, maybe a bit longer than a week, but that wasn\u8217\'20\'19t unusual \u8211\'20\'13 I\u8217\'20\'19d always had irregular periods. Like I had many times before, I picked up a test just in case. It came back positive.\par \par \uc2 I didn\u8217\'20\'19t tell anyone at school I was pregnant, but I called my mom. She assured me it would be OK, and told me to schedule an appointment nearby, rather than drive home to New York. She was right; I probably didn\u8217\'20\'19t need a seven-hour car ride of contemplative dread.\par \par \uc2 I never considered keeping it, and the why is not important. Regardless of my reasoning, know that no one wants to have an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It is a decision made out of personal necessity. I still think about it sometimes, riddled with whispers of unexpected guilt that I wonder if all women experience. The one feeling I didn\u8217\'20\'19t expect when thinking about my \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  was gratitude for its legality.\par \par \uc2 On Wednesday, the supreme court failed to block Texas\u8217\'20\'19s draconian law banning abortions after six weeks and offering a $10,000 reward to anyone who reports illegal abortions in the state. The six-week timeframe comes from the state\u8217\'20\'19s \u8220\'20\'1Cheartbeat bill\u8221\'20\'1D, which cites the earliest time an ultrasound can detect a \u8220\'20\'1Cfetal heartbeat\u8221\'20\'1D as the point of viability. Many doctors consider that fetal development to be electrical flickering, not a real heartbeat, and have called \u8220\'20\'1Cheartbeat\u8221\'20\'1D legislation {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2019/jun/05/abortion-doctors-fetal-heartbeat-bills-language-misleading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 misleading}}}\uc2 . As a demarcation point, it\u8217\'20\'19s also drastically earlier than Roe v Wade, which recognizes the point of viability at 24 to 28 weeks.\par \par \uc2 I wasn\u8217\'20\'19t able to schedule the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  for another week, so I had it at seven weeks \u8211\'20\'13 a week too late in Texas today\par \par \uc2 The majority of abortions, including mine, take place after six weeks. That\u8217\'20\'19s because it typically takes more than two weeks to figure out you\u8217\'20\'19re pregnant, make an appointment to get an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and get together the money to pay for the procedure, which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.compasscare.info/health-information/abortion/abortion-costs/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 costs $508}}}\uc2  on average in the United States.\par \par \uc2 It took me two weeks to get an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after I discovered I was pregnant. When I called my local Planned Parenthood, the earliest they could squeeze me in was a week later. That appointment wasn\u8217\'20\'19t for the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  itself; it was just to confirm the pregnancy. They told me I was six weeks pregnant, which meant that when I took the home test I was five weeks. I wasn\u8217\'20\'19t able to schedule the \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  for another week, so I had it at seven weeks \u8211\'20\'13 a week too late in Texas today.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s not uncommon to wait weeks for an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  appointment. Clinics are woefully underfunded. In 2019, Planned Parenthood gave up $60m in federal funding after Trump forbid Title X clinics from referring patients to \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  clinics. The Title X program, which serves low-income women, provides funds for a range of sexual health services, like STD testing and pregnancy prevention.\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/nearly-half-of-women-who-have-abortions-live-below-in-the-federal-poverty-level-2019-05-17"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 majority}}}\uc2  of women who get abortions are low income. These women, who are disproportionately Black and Latina, will suffer the consequences of this ban, just as they did in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.vice.com/en/article/43gyx9/poor-latina-black-women-most-screwed-texas-abortion-ban-hb2"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2014}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.guttmacher.org/gpr/2019/09/us-abortion-rate-continues-drop-once-again-state-abortion-restrictions-are-not-main"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2  shows that regardless of legality, women who are pregnant and don\u8217\'20\'19t want to be will continue to seek out abortions. Illegal abortions can be dangerous, but Texas has made them even more so by incentivizing citizens to report them. In the worst case, a woman could be prevented from accessing care so the provider won\u8217\'20\'19t face the hefty fine. It seems the ramifications of this law weren\u8217\'20\'19t even considered.\par \par \uc2 I can\u8217\'20\'19t help but picture myself in a Texas woman\u8217\'20\'19s shoes. My heart aches for them. I cannot imagine the pain and isolation I felt being worsened by the panic and desperation they will feel. And I fear that Texas is just the beginning. I can only hope it is not.\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Zo\u235\'00\'EB Ettinger is an editor and writer living in New York\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210907eh97002ut\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
