\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 TikTokers flood Texas  \highlight22\uc2 abortion \highlight\uc2  whistleblower site with Shrek memes, fake reports and porn\b0\par\par\uc2 Kari Paul \par \uc2 745 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 September 2021\par 18:52 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par 33\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2021.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Critics of Texas\u8217\'20\'19s new law have been filing hundreds of fake reports to the whistleblowing website in hopes of crashing it\par \par \uc2 Pro-choice users on TikTok and Reddit have launched a guerrilla effort to thwart Texas\u8217\'20\'19s extreme new \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  law, flooding an online tip website that encourages people to report violators of the law with false reports, Shrek memes and porn.\par \par \uc2 The law makes it illegal to help women in Texas access \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after the sixth week of pregnancy. To help enforce it, anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  group Texas Right to Life established the digital tipline where people can send anonymous information about potential violations.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAny Texan can bring a lawsuit against an abortionist or someone aiding and abetting an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  after six weeks,\u8221\'20\'1D the website reads, and those proved to be violating the law can be fined a minimum of $10,000. An online form allows anyone to submit an anonymous \u8220\'20\'1Creport\u8221\'20\'1D of someone illegally obtaining an \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2 , including a section where images can be uploaded for proof.\par \par \uc2 But pro-choice users had other ideas, bombarding the site with false reports and fabricated data through a campaign primarily organized on Reddit and TikTok.\par \par \uc2 Though the site was launched a month ago, the fake reports came flooding in on the eve of the bill\u8217\'20\'19s enactment. One TikTok user said they had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tiktok.com/@travelingnurse/video/7003093359573110021?is_copy_url=1&is_from_webapp=v1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 submitted 742 fake reports}}}\uc2  of the governor, Greg Abbott, getting illegal abortions.\par \par \uc2 In a tongue-in-cheek caption, the user encouraged others to do the same: \u8220\'20\'1CIt would be a shame if TikTok crashed the ProLifeWhistleBlower website.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Redditors said they had submitted reports blaming the state of Texas for facilitating abortions by having highways that allow people to travel to the procedure.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWouldn\u8217\'20\'19t it be so awful if we sent in a bunch of fake tips and crashed the site? Like, Greg Abbott\u8217\'20\'19s butt stinks,\u8221\'20\'1D {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tiktok.com/@victoriahammett/video/6999754769267035397?referer_url=https%3A%2F%2Foembed.vice.com%2F&referer_video_id=6999754769267035397&refer=embed"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 one TikTok creator said}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Please spread far and wide. The website she referred to is at: www. Prolifewhistleblower. Com {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/3YLStXiyht"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/3YLStXiyht}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Piyush Mittal (@piyushmittal) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/piyushmittal/status/1433305552600268807?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 2, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Another TikTok user showed how he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tiktok.com/@williamshaughn_/video/6999021314652523781?_d=secCgYIASAHKAESPgo8G3cNFALBnPFjMGDdP1LBUvOKPXBQvw4ddHEklsguyP%2Ff2HaccO0%2Fl7mbEqJY9OND1e5AYFXLjZrAq7TbGgA%3D&checksum=1fdd8ce817f37844faab3b3ec5a33b78cbeb1bc561c512f282f557d161b882e7&language=en&preview_pb=0&sec_user_id=MS4wLjABAAAA9KXC4aR53KLI1MSeXkIJSTY4w8mCKiPu1q6Y49YZU9a_hsmOYVbN-DF64GMSS_E9&share_app_id=1233&share_item_id=6999021314652523781&share_link_id=19ACF020-FA4D-42D2-94FF-1E8A18FA80B5&source=h5_m%C3%97tamp=1629839697&tt_from=copy&u_code=djkbcda7l4gdih&user_id=6988385123259827206&utm_campaign=client_share&utm_medium=ios&utm_source=copy&_r=1&is_copy_url=0&is_from_webapp=v1&sender_device=pc&sender_web_id=6899585999673951750"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 uploaded}}}\uc2  Shrek memes claiming they were images proving \u8220\'20\'1Cmy wife aborted our baby 4 weeks into her pregnancy without my consulting me\u8221\'20\'1D. Meanwhile, other users encouraged people to upload image attachments containing various kinds of porn.\par \par \uc2 The coordinated effort {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2020/jun/21/trump-tulsa-rally-scheme-k-pop-fans-tiktok-users"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 echoes}}}\uc2  a movement in June 2020 to flood a Donald Trump rally with fake sign-ups, resulting in an empty stadium for the actual event.\par \par \uc2 An activist who goes by the name Sean Black said he programmed a script to submit reports en masse on the website automatically.\par \par \uc2 It would be a shame if someone sent a ton of fake tips to the Texas pro-life whistleblower website\u8230\'20\'26 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SeanDaBlack?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @SeanDaBlack}}}\uc2  created an iOS shortcut to do just this. Idea inspired by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/0liviajulianna?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @0liviajulianna}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/HammettVictoria?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @HammettVictoria}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 iOS shortcut - {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/uOy5I8oYea"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/uOy5I8oYea}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/paAet9maEa"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/paAet9maEa}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Gabe Sanchez (@iamgabesanchez) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/iamgabesanchez/status/1433532350495805441?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 September 2, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 Black, who describes himself as a \u8220\'20\'1Cregular college student from North Carolina\u8221\'20\'1D, has released a Python script and an iOS shortcut for less tech-savvy to send thousands of reports a day.\par \par \uc2 He said his data shows nearly 8,000 people have used the Python code and 9,000 have used the iOS shortcut. Others have been inspired by his coding against anti-\b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  advocates, saying collaborators across the US are working with him on 10 \u8220\'20\'1Cactive branches\u8221\'20\'1D of new features in the tool.\par \par \uc2 The website appears to be doing its best to take on the influx of false reports and remains online despite other sabotage attempts including attacks by hackers.\par \par \uc2 Nancy C\u225\'00\'E1rdenas Pe\u241\'00\'F1a, a Texas director for the National Latina Institute for Reproductive Justice, said she was blocked by the website from using the form after she tweeted about it. Some web hosts allow people to block visitors to their sites by IP address.\par \par \uc2 Hey \uc2 Twitter\uc2 !An anti-choice org is seeking anonymous tips for people helping others seek \b \highlight22\uc2 abortion\b0 \highlight\uc2  care in Texas. Gosh,I wonder if they factored in people abusing the integrity of this system.Hmmm I hope ppl don't abuse this! That would be terrible ?? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/XR4XZLoobE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/XR4XZLoobE}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 Nancy C\u225\'00\'E1rdenas Pe\u241\'00\'F1a (@ncardenastx) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ncardenastx/status/1428861766432350218?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 August 20, 2021}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGosh, I wonder if they factored in people abusing the integrity of this system,\u8221\'20\'1D she said, jokingly adding: \u8220\'20\'1CHmmm I hope ppl don\u8217\'20\'19t abuse this! That would be terrible.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020210903eh930005l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
